    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 48 Daleview Road is a four bedroom semi-detached family home boasting a sunny West facing rear garden. Ideally located in a private, mature cul de sac all amenities are on your doorstep. The accommodation extends to 111 sq.m. and comprises; entrance porch, entrance hall with guest toilet off, living room, dining room, kitchen/breakfast room and utility room completes the ground floor. Upstairs there are four bedrooms, main bedroom en suite and family bathroom. Daleview is well located off the Rathbeale Road adjacent to Dublin Bus and the Swords Express bus routes. All amenities, including shops, schools, parks and playgrounds are within minutes’ walk. This property offers excellent potential in the right location!\r\n\r\n* Mature, established and convenient location\r\n* Small, quiet cul de sac\r\n* Sunny, West facing rear garden\r\n* Downstairs guest toilet\r\n* Utility room\r\n* Main bedroom with en suite\r\n* PVC front door and double glazed windows\r\n* Gas fired central heating\r\n* Pedestrian side entrance\r\n* Walking distance to all local amenities including a host of schools, shops, church, playgrounds, The Ward Rivervalley Park and Swords Main Street \r\n* Bus routes on your doorstep include:\r\nSwords Express – Express service to Dublin City Centre\r\nDublin Bus Routes 41 and 41C\r\n* Primary Schools close by:\r\nSt. Cronan’s Junior National School\r\nSwords Educate Together National School\r\nThornleigh Educate Together National School\r\nGaelscoil Brian Boroimhe\r\nBroadmeadow CNS\r\n* Secondary Schools:\r\nSwords Community College\r\nSt Finian’s Community College\r\nFingal Community College\r\nLoreto College\r\nColaiste Choilm"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR:\r\n\r\nEntrance porch\t-\tSliding porch door.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\t\t-\tLaminate flooring. Understairs storage. Guest toilet. Stairs to first floor. \r\n\r\nGuest toilet   -   1.6m x 0.8m\r\nFully tiled with toilet and sink.\r\n\t\t\t\r\nLiving room   -   5.1m x 3.6m\r\nFeature bay window. Laminate flooring. Feature fireplace. Double dividing doors to the dining room.\r\n\t\t\r\nDining room   -   4.5m x 3.0m\r\nLaminate flooring. Sliding patio door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen   -   6.1m x 2.5m\r\nFitted kitchen with laminate flooring. Door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nUtility room   -   1.8m x 1.5m\r\nTiled floor. Plumbed for washing machine. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR:\r\n\r\nLanding   -   Laminate flooring. Hotpress. Access hatch to attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1   -   4.4m x 3.2m (front right)\r\nDouble room with feature bay window. Laminate flooring. Built in wardrobes. En suite off.\r\n\r\nEn Suite   -   1.3m x 2.1m\r\nFully tiled. Shower, toilet and sink. Triton T90 electric shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2   -   3.8m x 2.8m (back right)\r\nDouble room. Laminate flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3   -   2.3m x 2.7m (back left)\r\nLaminate flooring. Built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4   -   2.3m x 2.3m (front left)\r\nSingle room. Laminate flooring. Built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBathroom   -   2.0m x 1.7m\r\nFully tiled. Bath, sink and toilet.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE:\r\nThere are walled gardens front and rear. Driveway to the front with pedestrian side entrance. Sunny, West facing rear garden."
      },
